What Brucia adds / changes relative to Bruce
--------------------------------------------
- A "companion" mode: the device streams data to, and is driven by, a native
  Android companion app that performs the heavy computation, storage and GUI.
- A transport-agnostic wire protocol (USB-CDC first, then Wi-Fi and BLE) defined
  in proto/.
- The native Android application under android/ (also AGPL-3.0).
- A browser-based firmware flasher (GitHub Pages) under docs/.
- Product/brand strings renamed from "Bruce" to "Brucia". Upstream copyright and
  license headers are preserved; only user-facing product naming is changed.
- platformio.ini: FastLED pinned to an exact version (3.10.3) for reproducible
  builds; the upstream caret range resolves to a version that does not compile
  with the current toolchain.

